  dialogueLines:
  - Woah, I haven't seen a smash cola can in forever. This was my favorite drink
    back in the day.
  - The last time I had one was... wait. When was the last time, and where?
  - I feel like I'm grabbing for soemthing, a memory, that isn't there.
